{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "hub.kami",
  "kind": "skill",
  "name": "Kami",
  "summary": "Kami (紙) delivers documents: eight built-in templates — resume, one-pager, letter, portfolio, long-doc, slides (PDF and editable PPTX), equity report, changelog — plus a product landing page, with serif CJK/Latin typography, warm paper backgrounds and a single ink-blue accent, eighteen diagram types and generated data charts. The skill locks a contract first (language, template, formats, length), fills templates from a strict content.json intermediate representation, then renders and gates with one command (--deliver: placeholder, strict-MathJax, density, orphan and actual-CJK-font checks) until READY. Use for 做 PDF / 排版 / 简历 / 一页纸 / PPT / slides or a Kami landing page; not for auditing or restyling an existing site, dark or cyberpunk aesthetics, or dynamic web app UI. Rendering needs Python WeasyPrint (pypdf/PyMuPDF) and Node.js 20 or 22+ for strict math; CJK serif fonts download on demand. Source-pointing carry of tw93/kami at the pinned commit. Licensed MIT.",
  "summaryI18n": {
    "zh-CN": "Kami（紙）负责交付文档：内置八类模板——简历、一页纸、信件、作品集、白皮书长文、幻灯片（PDF 与可编辑 PPTX）、个股研报、更新日志——外加产品落地页，衬线中西文字体、暖色纸面与单一墨蓝点缀，含十八种示意图与数据生成的图表。先锁定合同（语言、模板、格式、篇幅），用严格的 content.json 中间表示填模板，再以一条命令渲染并过门检查（--deliver：占位符、严格 MathJax 公式、密度、孤行与真实中文字体检查）直到 READY。用于做 PDF／排版／简历／一页纸／PPT 或 Kami 落地页；不用于审计或重做既有网站、暗色赛博风格或动态 Web 应用。渲染需 Python WeasyPrint（pypdf/PyMuPDF），严格公式渲染需 Node.js 20 或 22+，中文字体按需下载。自 tw93/kami 钉住 commit 来源指向携带。许可证 MIT。"
  },
