  "permissionsNote": "SKILL.md declares no allowed-tools; tool use is the host's decision. Local dependency-free Python render/check (optional weasyprint/pypdf/PyMuPDF/Pygments); builds render offline. Network paths, user-initiated and bounded: daily GitHub release-tag check (no upload), brand CSS fetch of a user-given URL (same-host, <=5 sheets, byte/time caps), CJK font and pinned MathJax downloads, jsDelivr fallbacks. Optional stdio MCP server (local HTML only). Needs Python 3 + WeasyPrint; Node 20/22+ for LaTeX."
